<title>GREECE: Turkish truck enters Greece, three arrested - police.</title>
<headline>Turkish truck enters Greece, three arrested - police.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Turkish soldiers and a civilian aboard a truck that burst through the Evros border post in northern Greece on Monday were arrested after an hour-long chase, Greek police said.</p>
<p>&quot;The soldiers said they did not want to serve in the Turkish army. They did not stop at the the border checkpoint and we don't know how they got through the Turkish authorities,&quot; a police spkesman said.</p>
<p>He said the three men would be charged later on Monday with entering Greece illegally.</p>
</text>
